#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"The three <application>Gnumeric</application> toolbars can either be hidden "
"from view or shown above or below the cell grid area. The three different "
"toolbars are explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-toolbars\"/>."
msgstr ""
"De tre verktygsraderna i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan döljas "
"eller visas ovanför eller nedanför cellrutnätet. De olika verktygsraderna "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-toolbars\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:10
msgid ""
"Toolbars can be hidden or shown by clicking with the primary mouse button on"
" the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu, the dragging the pointer down to the "
"<guimenuitem>Toolbars</guimenuitem> to open its submenu and then moving the "
"pointer into the sub-menu listing the three toolbars. By default each "
"toolbar appears with a small check mark in front of its name indicating that"
" it is visible. Clicking on any of the toolbars will alter its setting, "
"making the toolbar visible if it is hidden or hiding the toolbar if it is "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Du kan visa eller dölja verktygsrader genom att klicka med musens "
"primärknapp på menyn <guimenu>Visa</guimenu>, dra pekaren till "
"<guimenuitem>Verktygsrader</guimenuitem> för att öppna undermenyn och sedan "
"flytta pekaren till listan med verktygsrader. Som standard visas en liten "
"bock framför varje synlig verktygsrad. Klicka på en verktygsrad om du vill "
"ändra dess visning: en dold verktygsrad visas och en synlig verktygsrad "
"döljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> allows users to configure the plugins "
"which are currently in use. The <guilabel>Plugin Manager</guilabel> provides"
" all the configuration options in one location."
msgstr ""
"I <application>Gnumeric</application> kan du hantera de insticksmoduler som "
"används. Alla inställningar finns samlade i <guilabel>hanteraren för "
"insticksmoduler</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:10
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Plugin Manager</guilabel> can be started by clicking on the "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu and selecting the "
"<guimenuitem>Plugins...</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Öppna <guilabel>hanteraren för insticksmoduler</guilabel> genom att klicka "
"på menyn <guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu> och välja menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Insticksmoduler...</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:16
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Plugin Manager</guilabel> is a tabbed dialog with three tabs. "
"The first tab, labeled <guilabel>Plugin List</guilabel>, provides a list of "
"all the currently visible plugins, the second tab, labeled <guilabel>Plugin "
"Details</guilabel> provides details on the plugin selected in the first tab."
" The third tab, labeled <guilabel>Directories</guilabel> lists the "
"directories which are currently searched to discover new plugins."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>hanteraren för insticksmoduler</guilabel> är en dialogruta med tre"
" flikar. Den första fliken, <guilabel>Lista över insticksmoduler</guilabel>,"
" visar alla synliga insticksmoduler. Den andra fliken, <guilabel>Information"
" om insticksmodul</guilabel>, visar information om den modul som är markerad"
" på den första fliken. Den tredje fliken, <guilabel>Kataloger</guilabel>, "
"visar de kataloger som genomsöks efter nya insticksmoduler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:27
msgid ""
"The first tab provides a list of plugins, an explanation of each and a "
"method to activate or de-activate the plugin. The list includes all of the "
"plugins which have been found by <application>Gnumeric</application> in the "
"directories listed in the third tab. An explanation can be obtained for each"
" plugin by selecting the plugin from the list by placing the mouse pointer "
"over the plugin name and clicking with the primary mouse button. The "
"explanation will then appear in the bottom text area. The active column "
"provides check boxes in front of each listed plugin. If the box contains a "
"check mark, the plugin has been activated and its functionality should be "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Den första fliken visar en lista med insticksmoduler, en beskrivning av "
"varje modul och ett sätt att aktivera eller inaktivera den. Listan omfattar "
"alla moduler som <application>Gnumeric</application> har hittat i "
"katalogerna på den tredje fliken. Visa en moduls beskrivning genom att "
"markera den i listan med musens primärknapp. Beskrivningen visas då i "
"textområdet längst ned. I kolumnen Aktiv finns en kryssruta för varje "
"insticksmodul. Om rutan är markerad är modulen aktiverad och dess funktioner"
" ska vara tillgängliga."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Languages and Locales"
msgstr "Språk och regioninställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can be run in many languages with "
"settings for number formats, currencies and dates appropriate to each "
"particular area. Unfortunately, this aspect of the program is exceedingly "
"complex and requires the proper participation of the underlying operating "
"system. This dependency makes it impossible for this manual to provide a "
"complete explanation. The operating system should include a complete "
"discussion of locales and location settings."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan köras på många språk och med format "
"för tal, valutor och datum som passar olika regioner. Den här delen av "
"programmet är mycket komplex och kräver stöd från det underliggande "
"operativsystemet. Därför kan handboken inte förklara allt. Operativsystemets"
" dokumentation bör innehålla en fullständig beskrivning av inställningar för"
" språk och region."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"By default, <application>Gnumeric</application> finds the configuration "
"currently used by the user and sets the language and locale settings "
"appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Som standard hittar <application>Gnumeric</application> användarens aktuella"
" konfiguration och ställer in språk och region därefter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"LC_ALL=fr_FR gnumeric &amp;\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"LC_ALL=fr_FR gnumeric &amp;\n"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:20
msgid ""
"It is also possible to run <application>Gnumeric</application> using the "
"language and locale settings for a different place. This should be possible "
"simply by redefining the <userinput>LC_ALL</userinput> environmental "
"variable. For example, using the <application>bash</application> shell it "
"should be possible, within a terminal, type: <_:screen-1/> to make gnumeric "
"open with its menus displayed in French and using the french convention for "
"numbers and currency."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även köra <application>Gnumeric</application> med inställningar för "
"språk och region för en annan plats. Det kan oftast göras genom att ändra "
"miljövariabeln <userinput>LC_ALL</userinput>. I ett terminalfönster med "
"skalet <application>bash</application> kan du till exempel skriva: "
"<_:screen-1/> för att starta gnumeric med franska menyer och franska format "
"för tal och valuta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:826
msgid "Working with Files"
msgstr "Arbeta med filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Files in Gnumeric"
msgstr "Filer i Gnumeric"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:6
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> stores its information by creating files"
" and re-opening these files during a future session. Saving information to "
"files also allows a user to send the information to others."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> sparar information i filer som kan "
"öppnas igen vid ett senare tillfälle. När informationen sparas i en fil kan "
"den också skickas till andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:12
msgid ""
"The default file format for <application>Gnumeric</application> is based on "
"the eXtensible Markup Language (XML). By default, files are saved as text "
"files, consisting of XML, which are then compressed using the library of the"
" <application>gzip</application> program. The extension for "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> files is <literal>.gnumeric</literal> on"
" platforms which support file extensions of any size, "
"<literal>.gnum</literal> for systems which restrict extensions to four "
"letters, or <literal>.gnm</literal> for systems which restrict extensions to"
" three letters."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> använder som standard filformatet "
"Extensible Markup Language (XML). Filerna sparas som XML-text och "
"komprimeras sedan med biblioteket från programmet "
"<application>gzip</application>. Filtillägget för "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-filer är <literal>.gnumeric</literal> på"
" plattformar som tillåter filnamnstillägg av valfri längd, "
"<literal>.gnum</literal> på system som begränsar tillägget till fyra "
"bokstäver och <literal>.gnm</literal> på system som begränsar det till tre "
"bokstäver."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can also open or save files in a number "
"of other file formats. The project prides itself for the work reverse "
"engineering and supporting the file formats used by Microsoft Excel. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can use the Excel file format as if it "
"were the native file format, meaning that "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can store and retrieve essentially every"
" aspect of a worksheet using the Excel format. Similarly, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> supports the OASIS Open Document Format "
"for Office Applications (ODF 1.2) file format (ISO/IEC 26300:2006/Amd "
"1:2012) as well as the ECMA 376 2nd Edition file format (ISO/IEC 29500:2008)"
" as if they were the native format."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan även öppna och spara filer i flera "
"andra format. Projektet är stolt över arbetet med att baklängeskonstruera "
"och stödja filformaten i Microsoft Excel. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan använda Excelformat som sitt eget, "
"vilket innebär att <application>Gnumeric</application> kan spara och läsa "
"tillbaka i stort sett alla delar av ett kalkylblad i det formatet. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> stöder även filformatet OASIS Open "
"Document Format for Office Applications (ODF 1.2; ISO/IEC 26300:2006/Amd "
"1:2012) och ECMA 376 2nd Edition (ISO/IEC 29500:2008) som om de vore "
"programmets egna format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:38
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> cannot delete files from the file "
"system. <application>Gnumeric</application> can open existing files and "
"create new files but cannot delete files once they are created. Files can be"
" deleted using a file browser such as <application>Nautilus</application> on"
" the GNOME desktop or using the command-line program "
"<application>rm</application>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan inte ta bort filer från filsystemet."
" <application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna befintliga filer och skapa "
"nya, men inte ta bort filer när de väl har skapats. Ta bort filer med en "
"filhanterare, till exempel <application>Nautilus</application> i GNOME, "
"eller med kommandoradsprogrammet <application>rm</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:48
msgid ""
"This chapter discusses working with actual files. It is also possible to "
"import data into <application>Gnumeric</application> using the clipboard by "
"copying either text or html table information in another program and then "
"pasting the resulting data into a worksheet. See <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"movecopy-xclipboard\"/> for details."
msgstr ""
"Det här kapitlet handlar om att arbeta med filer. Du kan även importera data"
" till <application>Gnumeric</application> via urklipp genom att kopiera text"
" eller en HTML-tabell från ett annat program och klistra in data i ett "
"kalkylblad. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-"
"xclipboard\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:57
msgid ""
"Text files are often used to store data, using many different systems to "
"structure the data such as using commas, tabs or spaces to separate values. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> features a flexible system that enables "
"users to define exactly the structure of the text file to be imported or "
"exported."
msgstr ""
"Textfiler används ofta för att lagra data. Värden kan avgränsas på olika "
"sätt, till exempel med kommatecken, tabbar eller blanksteg. I "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan du själv ange exakt hur en textfil "
"ska tolkas vid import och export."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:65
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can be integrated with an email client "
"to allow files to be sent directly as attachments to an electronic mail "
"message."
msgstr ""
"Du kan integrera <application>Gnumeric</application> med en e-postklient och"
" skicka filer direkt som bilagor i e-postmeddelanden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:70
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> also features a command-line tool called"
" <application>ssconvert</application> to convert files between any of the "
"file formats which it supports."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har även kommandoradsverktyget "
"<application>ssconvert</application>, som konverterar filer mellan de format"
" som programmet stöder."
